  m_text: "Dragon Knight: A formidable dragon warrior with the following abilities: 
    \r\nThrusts its spear forward, piercing through enemies.  \r\n\r\nSlams its fiery
    spear into the ground, causing a fiery explosion around it.  \r\n\r\nBreathes
    fire forward, incinerating everything in its path.  \r\n\r\nBreathes fire into
    the ground, making flames erupt from below, dealing surprise damage.  \r\n\r\nDashes
    forward, dealing heavy damage along its path.\r\n\r"
